  "rationale": "<5-8 sentences, 120-200 words; decisive lead; explicit walk-through of inclusions then exclusions; prescreen-doctrine sentence when deferring; closing decisive label; verbatim quantities; no glossy closers; no inferred diagnoses>"
}
